sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor user as User
  participant cli as sidetone.py
  participant state as state.json
  participant sd as systemd --user
  participant sup as Supervisor
  user->>cli: python3 sidetone.py on
  Note over cli: SIDETONE_BT_ADDR must be a real address
  cli->>state: ensure state file exists
  cli->>sd: systemctl --user enable --now
  sd->>sup: ExecStart sidetone.py supervise
  cli-->>user: status: service, gate decision, routing, gain readback
